{"title":"반사회적 안전지대 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"\"네가 여자가 아니라면… 난 필요 없는데.\"\n\n세계 전역에 좀비가 발생한 지 3개월. 강력한 변종 좀비들이 나타나며 사회 인프라가 빠르게 무너지고, 무법지대가 된 망가진 세상 속 사람들은 생존을 위해 극단적으로 변했다.\n\n한편 안전한 벙커에서 지내던 보연은 도경에게 발견되어 협박당하게 된다. 생존을 위해 보연은 차갑고 비밀스러운 그의 '여자'로 지내며 도경의 보호 아래 살아가게 되는데….\n\n위험하지만 벗어날 수 없는,\n<반사회적 안전지대>","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-11-04","rank":26,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-05","rank":35,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-11-06","rank":37,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-11-07","rank":50,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-11-08","rank":61,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-11-09","rank":73,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-11-10","rank":81,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-11-11","rank":117,"change":{"type":"down","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-11-12","rank":152,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":119,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":110,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-11-15","rank":148,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-11-16","rank":130,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-11-17","rank":123,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-11-18","rank":145,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-11-19","rank":140,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-11-20","rank":142,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-11-21","rank":143,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-11-22","rank":149,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-11-23","rank":137,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-11-24","rank":156,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-11-25","rank":165,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-11-26","rank":166,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-11-04","rank":1